  "question": {
    "text": "An element with molar mass <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.7</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi>mol</mi><mrow><mo>&#8722;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> forms a cubic unit cell with edge length <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>405</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>pm</mi><mo>.</mo></math> If its density is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>7</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math>, the radius of the element is approximately <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>&#8230;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>12</mn></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math> (to the nearest integer)"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "143",
  "solution": {
